      "html": "<div class=\"post__content post__content--new-editor\"><p>I looked. If it’s possible, I don’t see a way to do it.</p><p>Pretty massive flaw to be missing that functionality.</p><p> </p><p>User knows a thread exists about “ADC3” (for example) in the past 3 days but doesn’t have a link. Only way to find it now is to endlessly click the “load more” button if it doesn’t show up top in the search results.</p></div>"
